<title>UK: SOCCER-ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE MATCH SUMMARY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE MATCH SUMMARY.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of English premier league match played on Monday: Everton 1 (Graham Stuart penalty 45th) Coventry 1 (Gary McAllister 68). Halftime 1-0. Attendance: 31,477</p>
